    "Use this only if your website is currently under a DDoS attack. Visitors will receive an interstitial page for a few seconds while we analyze their traffic and behavior to make sure they are a legitimate human visitor.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
